        <p class="lede">
          The best protein shaker bottle for most people is the <strong>BlenderBottle Classic V2</strong>: a wire-whisk BlenderBall that breaks up whey in about 20 seconds, a screw lid with a reputation for not leaking, top-rack dishwasher cleaning and a low price. If you want your shake cold for hours, the stainless BlenderBottle Radian is the upgrade, and if you hate washing a mixing ball, the ball-free ShakeSphere Tumbler is the best alternative.
        </p>

        <QuickPicks products={PRODUCTS} />

