            1. Quick Comparison: The Best Protein Shaker Bottles
          </h2>

          <p>
            The short version: buy the BlenderBottle Classic V2 unless you have a specific reason not to. Choose the BlenderBottle Radian or Ice Shaker if you want an insulated stainless bottle that stays cold and does not smell, the Pro32 if you make big shakes, the ShakeSphere Tumbler if you hate the loose ball, and the Helimix if your powder is gritty or thick. The table below compares capacity, mixing mechanism and material, all from the brand or retailer listing at the time of writing.
          </p>

          <div class="overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl my-8">
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
              <table class="w-full text-left">
                <thead class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
                  <tr>
